The external platform owns:
- campaigns
- campaign_game_instances
- leads
- rewards
- redemption
- CTA content
- lead field rules
- campaign-level overrides

This Trivia app owns:
- shells
- question bank
- answers
- difficulty
- shell defaults
- visual presentation config
- runtime execution

Do not absorb platform responsibilities into Trivia.

